          "state": [
            "waiting on a person"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "failure",
          "title": "Failure is recoverable; blocked is not",
          "body": "A failed execution returns to executing for a retry. A run blocked at review has no way back; it expires. The two look similar and behave very differently.",
